Healthcare Disclaimer
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This software is provided for use in healthcare settings subject to the
OpenMRS Healthcare Disclaimer at http://openmrs.org/license. In short: this
software is not a medical device, carries no warranty of fitness for
clinical use, and any clinical decision remains the responsibility of a
qualified practitioner.

That disclaimer matters more than usual here. This module sends clinical
questions and patient data to a third-party language model provider when an
API key is configured, and presents generated text to clinicians. See
SECURITY.md before deploying it against real patient records.
